; gap: 2px;\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #ffB2E7; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #FA3DBE, 0 0 2px #FA3DBE, 0 0 2px #FA3DBE;\">Rose </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/87/Damage_type_Rose.png/revision/latest?cb=20230621053604\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Rose\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/87/Damage_type_Rose.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230621053604\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Rose.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Rose.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Attack Stats</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"damage\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Damage</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0 -&gt;</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"seconds_per_attack\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Attack Rate</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0 -&gt;</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"range\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Range</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7 -&gt;</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"mobile-hidden game-font-face advanced-tooltip\" style=\"position: relative; user-select: none;z-index: 5;color: #ffffff8f;font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"dottedText C(#3a3a3a)-Th-L\" style=\"position: absolute; top: -43px; right: 0; cursor: help; border-bottom: 2px dotted;\">Why do I have different stats?</div><div class=\"tooltip-contents\" style=\"display: none\"><div class=\"game-tooltip&#95;&#95;container game-font-face\">Units in this game use a randomized system, where stats like damage are randomly rolled with about a 10% variance (like Dungeon Quest items). When you evolve a unit they also reroll their stats, but it will always be strictly better than the pre-evolved version.</div></div></div><div class=\"article-table mobileonly\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Frequently_Asked_Questions\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions\">Why do I have different stats?</a></i><br /></div><div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; z-index: 5;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; width: 124px; justify-content: flex-start; position: absolute; left: 234px; top: -48px; flex-direction: column-reverse; align-items: center;\">\n<div class=\"mw-customtoggle-Buff&#95;OFF mw-customtoggle-Buff&#95;ON\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Buff&#95;ON\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; width: 100px;\">\n<div class=\"buffList\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-content: center; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 100%;\">\n<p>Buff\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Buff&#95;OFF\" style=\"display: none; transform: translate(0, -70px);\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column-reverse; align-items: center;gap: 3px;\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; width: 100px;\">\n<div class=\"buffList\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-content: center; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 100%;\">\n<p>Buff\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 4px;\">\n<div class=\"mw-customtoggle-Sakura\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sakura\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hidden Scale(1.061):h game-font-face buffList-B-Sakuro ChBox&#95;item\" style=\"border-radius: 5px; background: -webkit-linear-gradient(90deg,#277a