ine\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p>Oshy has the ability to give a Damage Boost to any unit you place <u><b>no matter where she is</b> <b>placed</b></u> on the map. (After evolving, she gets Cost Decrease Buff which decreases upgrade costs)\n</p>\n<ul><li>This cannot stack with <a href=\"/wiki/Blossom\" title=\"Blossom\">Blossom</a> buff.</li>\n<li>Note that her normal version isn't limited. She's the first unit to do so.</li>\n<li>She is the first unit to have her banner version after debuting as a battlepass unit.</li>\n<li>If you see her on the banner, that isn't the limited version.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022150202\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.209 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.231 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1112/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 70116/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1104/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 12/100\nExpensive parser function count: 8/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 42/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.150/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 7594637/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  209.560      1 -total\n 68.57%  143.697      1 Template:EvolutionTable\n 17.83%   37.372      1 Template:Tower_Infobox\n 14.95%   31.319      1 Template:EvolutionTable/container\n 10.92%   22.889      1 Template:Main_Stats\n  8.82%   18.474      1 Template:Item\n  8.48%   17.780      3 Template:Stats_Box\n  3.87%    8.105      1 Template:Characterbox\n  2.18%    4.568      4 Template:Format_decimal\n  1.21%    2.529      1 Template:Item/unit\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_animeadventures853:pcache:idhash:3255-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261022150202 and revision id 45748. Rendering was triggered because: page-vi